wXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"aI2w94F3TvIuPTcflKVCJQ","review_id":"5HjPIukiMmh3rZf1iqI1cQ","date":"2013-01-20T22:56:49","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9427788257598877,"text_excerpt":"Yum, Boba tea in a nicely decorated, warm and inviting shop. This part of Magazine street I feel is very under-rated with lots of small shops, boutiques, bars, restaurants and coffee shops. I was on a mission to get some bubble tea today and headed down to Honeydeux for a delicious treat. I'll def be back for more"},{"business_id":"aI2w94F3TvIuPTcflKVCJQ","review_id":"Y9QfhUAy2CVWx7GYlSEQ9w","date":"2015-01-08T22:51:14","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9298246502876282,"text_excerpt":"Walking into this establishment the decor is eclectic which is awesome. I just love the little bar stools at the counter. Extremely kid friendly. The guy who made my to die for mango strawberry bubble tea with tapioca and strawberry popping bubbles (you know strangely enough I've never had popping bubbles before) is awesome and super friendly. I'd say this place is a winner with some of the most delicious bubble tea and ridiculously warm service . Will definitely be back. UPDATE: Still craving their bubble tea three days after. Bubble tea was obliterated so fast that I didn't get to take a picture lol. I NEED MORE IN MY LIFE! Also I ordered a buffalo chicken wrap which was grilled (faaaan..."},{"business_id":"aI2w94F3TvIuPTcflKVCJQ","review_id":"ynVKkEqFSJX0B_c_I5sqVg","date":"2014-01-27T20:30:16","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.927815318107605,"text_excerpt":"The bubble tea gods have smiled upon us here in New Orleans! Although I know you can get bubble tea at various Vietnamese restaurants in the city, sometimes you just want a quick grab & go plastic cup of blended frozen deliciousness STAT. If I worked in the area, I'd definitely stop into Honeydeux on the regular, especially during those times when I'm on a coffee hiatus (rare, but it happens). Their menu features a decent variety of flavors from fruity to tea-based and if you're allergic to super sugary concoctions like I am, you can get them to adjust that, as well. I went for a blended Thai iced tea version and it's pretty on-point. The consistency of the pearls is excellent, although f..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"aI2w94F3TvIuPTcflKVCJQ","photo_id":"7dyujV1PcHJ14mH_6Ck3lw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/7dyujV1PcHJ14mH_6Ck3lw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9999999403953552}]},"notebook_case":null}
